# Testing rules

## Commands

```bash
npm test              # Vitest unit tests (tests/phase-*/unit/)
npm run test:e2e      # Playwright — server must be on port 3100
npm run lint && npm run build
```

## E2e layout

- Config: `tests/e2e/playwright.config.ts`
- Specs: `pokedex-ui.spec.ts` (layout/flows), `ui-contrast.spec.ts` (theme, watermark, toolbar)
- Helpers: `tests/e2e/helpers.ts` — `waitForAppReady`, `enableDarkTheme`, `getBodyBeforeStyle` (reads `documentElement::before`)
- Artifacts: `tests/artifacts/test-results/` (gitignored)

## When adding UI behavior

- Add or update a desktop e2e assertion in `ui-contrast.spec.ts` for theme/layout regressions
- Use bounding-box checks for overlap (sprite vs text, toolbar vs cards)
- Watermark tests: opacity via `getBodyBeforeStyle`, not `body::before`

## Reports

- Phase results: `tests/reports/phase-*-report.md`
- Do not commit secrets; no `.env` required for CI
